<title>USA: CardioDynamics names new president.</title>
<headline>CardioDynamics names new president.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CardioDynamics International Corp said Friday it has named chief operating officer Rhonda Pederson president.</p>
<p>Pederson assumes part of the duties of Richard Otto, who had been both president and chief executive officer, the company said. Otto is remaining CEO, while Pederson becomes president.</p>
<p>The company also said Richard Trayler has been named chief operating officer.</p>
